  "doc_id": "01a0742b-8524-77fa-82d5-14970cde8c21",
  "text": "## Template 6: Card Replacement Confirmation  \n**Subject:** Your Replacement Card Is On Its Way  \n```\nDear [Customer Name],\n\nYour replacement card has been issued and is on its way.\n\nCard Details:\n- Card Type: [Debit/Credit Card]\n- Last 4 Digits: [XXXX]\n- Replacement Reason: [Lost / Damaged / Expired / Other]\n- Estimated Arrival: [date range, 3–5 business days]\n\nImportant:\nYour old card is blocked and can no longer be used.\n\nWhile Waiting:\n✓ Online banking still works\n✓ Mobile app still works\n✓ Standing orders and Direct Debits continue normally\n✓ Visit a branch to withdraw cash if needed\n\nYour New Card:\nWhen it arrives, activate it by logging into your account at\nwww.firstuk.bank/login and clicking \"Activate Card.\"\n\nExpedited Replacement?\nIf you needed the card sooner, we offer overnight delivery for £25.\nContact us to arrange.\n\nQuestions?\n- Phone: 0800-555-2265\n- Email: support@firstuk.bank\n\nThank you,\nFirstUK Bank Team\n```  \n---",
  "name": "Chunk 8/15",
  "_domain": "banking.communications",
  "prev_chunk_id": "01a0742b-8524-77fa-82d5-14970cde8c21_007",
  "next_chunk_id": "01a0742b-8524-77fa-82d5-14970cde8c21_009",
